The Mechanical and Biomedical Engineering department is looking for an engineer with strong practical and analytical skills.  Working predominantly across healthcare projects, you will use your engineering skills at all stages of the development life-cycle.  You will take responsibility for design challenges and technical problems, participating in concept generation, research, design and testing.   &nbsp;

